---
title: North Dakota Whole Wheat Bread
author: Marge Arntson
category: Bread of Life
cook time: 1 hour
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@whole wheat{3%cups}
@oatmeal{1%cup}
@dry yeast{2%Tbsp}
@sugar{2%Tbsp}
@warm water{1%cup}
@sugar{0.5%cup}
@oil{2/3%cup}
@white flour{8-9%cups}
@rye{1%cup}
@hot water{4%cups}
@salt{2%Tbsp}
@molasses{1/3%cup}

Let rise, knead and let rise again. Makes 6 loaves. Bake at 375-400 degrees for 1 hour.
